            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="REVIEW QUESTION/OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">The objective of the systematic review is to synthesize the best available evidence on the effectiveness of thoracic paravertebral block compared with the use of systemic analgesia on postoperative pain in patients who have undergone a thoracotomy procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
